  "project_description": "This module integrates the MathJax library into your Drupal site. MathJax is the modern JavaScript-based LaTeX rendering solution for the Internet.\n\n MathJax is one of several options for rendering LaTeX formulas on your Drupal site.\n\n Features \n \n Load the MathJax library from its CDN or host it on your server (using Libraries API ). \n Customize the MathJax configuration. \n Use MathJax as a text filter. This allows site admins and content editors fine-grained control over which fields apply MathJax formatting.",
